    basicConversation:
    - id: 0
      conversation: Hmm... First is normal item. There are items which have been upgraded, with better performance, called rare items. There are also items called Blessed Item. It is much more special and very well done, but will be quite hard to find. If you obtain these kind of items, could you keep them properly? And... I have some items which I have never seen, but really precious items. By looking at the information record of our department, you should be able to enquire and obtain it. Ah, there is one type of item which cannot be used on your own will.  I can't help you with this item as it will be little bit difficult Please use it only when you are on quest training.
